    `_create_enqueue_native(...)` in its own `try/except Exception`,
    surfacing the failure as a status-bar message. Deliberately does NOT
    call `_fail_create_job` and does NOT touch `_create_job_active` -- that
    flag belongs to the FIRST job, which is still running; only the second
    click's (failed) enqueue attempt is affected.

