tt-local-generator (0.32.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * New GUI-free `ModelStatusService` (app/model_status.py): one poll loop that
    is the single source of truth for every managed server/model's state --
    off / starting / ready / error. It merges managed-server health checks with
    the artgen port-sweep (so a chat model started on any port still reads as
    ready), tracks a real 'starting' state (both app-initiated starts and an
    inferred-starting for external servers whose port is open but health hasn't
    passed), exposes a subscribe API (change-only notifications), and offers
    capability helpers (ready_keys / running_or_starting) for auto-selecting a
    running model. Foundation for unifying the app's four ad-hoc health pollers
    and adding at-a-glance loading indicators (wired to surfaces next). No UI or
    generation behavior changes yet.

